nc" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_bd208d41c28fbdc474d8381a52a5048b.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_bd208d41c28fbdc474d8381a52a5048b.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_bd208d41c28fbdc474d8381a52a5048b.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span><span class="contents"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4 md:w-5 xl:w-3.5 text-base font-heading font-bold leading-none select-none" style="color:#F0D060;text-shadow:0 0 6px #F0D06080" aria-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(240,208,96,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(240,208,96,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #F0D06025, inset 0 0 0 1px #F0D06030"><img alt="Step 6" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_e34f614b0fe2d29abc6364e3a2ab4969.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_e34f614b0fe2d29abc6364e3a2ab4969.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_e34f614b0fe2d29abc6364e3a2ab4969.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed md:flex-1">Yin should use his 1st Skill to gain Movement Speed and then his 2nd Skill to get close to a key enemy and hit them with his enhanced Basic Attack before trapping them in his Ultimate. In Lieh form, use his 2nd Skill to stun the enemy and finish them off with his 1st Skill.</p></div></div></section></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 items-start mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="hero-overview relative lg:pl-4 lg:border-l lg:border-[#C8AA6E]/30"><span class="hidden lg:block absolute left-0 top-0 w-1 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0D060] via-[#C8AA6E] to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-[15px]">Yin is a jungle fighter built around one question: can you find the right target and beat them alone in eight seconds? Everything in his kit feeds that question, and understanding its limits is what separates players who win with him from players who feed their own team.</p></div><section class="dossier-card relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-border-default overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -22px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" aria-label="Hero at-a-glance stats and attributes"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-mlbb-gold/0 via-mlbb-gold-bright/60 to-mlbb-gold/0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative p-4 md:p-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center justi