 must survive longer domain duels and messy Lord exits.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Retribution Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Jungle Domain Bruiser build for Yin.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin#build-jungle-domain-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 2 in the Jungle Domain Bruiser build for Yin.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin#build-jungle-domain-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Hunter Strike\",\"text\":\"Purchase Hunter Strike (2,010 gold) as item 3 in the Jungle Domain Bruiser build for Yin.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin#build-jungle-domain-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Queen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 4 in the Jungle Domain Bruiser build for Yin.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin#build-jungle-domain-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle Domain Bruiser build for Yin.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin#build-jungle-domain-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Domain Bruiser build for Yin.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin#build-jungle-domain-bruiser\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/yin\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":113,\"name\":\"Yin\",\"slug\":\"yin\",\"title\":\"Martial Genius\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\",\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Burst\",\"Control\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\",\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2022,\"stats\":{\"durability\":50,\"offense\":60,\"controlEffect\":80,\"difficulty\":40},\"winRate\":48.92,\"pickRate\":0.46,\"banRate\":1.62,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Yin counters squishy heroes without Blink skills like Layla and Cecilion because they will have a hard time dodging his Golden Rings. Once they are stunned or trapped in his Ultimate, Yin can easily finish them off.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"cecilion\",\"heroName\":\"Cecilion\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Yin counters squishy heroes without Blink skills like Layla and Cecilion because they will have a hard time dodging his Golden Rings. Once they are stunned or trapped in his Ultimate, Yin can easily finish them off.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"fredrinn\",\"heroName\":\"Fredrinn\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Yin is countered by Fighters that can interrupt skills, such as Fredrinn and Badang, because they can easily interrupt his Ultimate during the initial delay. These heroes can also hold their own in a duel, making them risky targets for Yin's Ultimate.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"badang\",\"heroName\":\"Badang\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Yin is countered by Fighters that can interrupt skills, such as Fredrinn and Badang, because they can easily interrupt his Ultimate during the initial delay. These heroes can also hold their own in a duel, making them risky targets for Yin's Ultimate.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_5324c7bcbfd9932aca9b8d2e7b8e307a.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee1c12c84f49514a30e405fb5c617796.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Leave It to Me\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"If there are no allied heroes within 4 units of Yin, his damage is increased to 120% and he gains 8% Spell Vamp.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If there are no allied heroes within 4 units of Yin, his damage is increased to 120% and he gains 8% Spell Vamp.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_10e337fa6398a8ea4a471155c8c22c1c.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Charged Punch\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Yin gains 60% extra Movement Speed (decays over 3s).\\nDuring this time, his next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 25 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. If the enhanced Basic Attack hits an enemy, Yin throws a charged punch forward, dealing 360 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path.\\nSuccessfully throwing the charged punch reduces the skill's cooldown by 35%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yin gains 60% extra Movement Speed (decays over 3s).\\nDuring this time, his next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 25\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". If the enhanced Basic Attack hits an enemy, Yin throws a charged punch forward, dealing 360\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+200% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies in its path.\\nSuccessfully throwing the charged punch reduces the skill's cooldown by 35%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_927d2396bfbe124ced32fec90158a316.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Speed Up\"]},{\"name\":\"Instant Blast\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Yin dashes forward, leaving a Golden Ring behind while dealing 75 (+35% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the way. He gains 30% extra Damage Reduction for 4s if an enemy hero is hit.\\nAfter 1s, the Golden Ring will catch up with Yin, dealing 150 (+70% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies it passes through and stunning them for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yin dashes forward, leaving a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Golden Ring\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" behind while dealing 75\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+35% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies along the way. He gains 30% extra Damage Reduction for 4s if an enemy hero is hit.\\nAfter 1s, the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Golden Ring\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" will catch up with Yin, dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+70% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies it passes through and stunning them for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9840f60d6b05aa1cb9513397d574df12.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"My Turn\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"After a short delay, Yin locks onto an enemy hero (cannot lock onto pets or clones) and pulls them into a domain for up to 8s and turns into Lieh. When in the domain, the two cannot be affected by other heroes' skills.\\n\\nLieh has stronger skills and 50 extra Physical Defense and Magic Defense that last 8s.\\nThe domain will end early if either of the two is killed. If Lieh successfully kills the enemy, he'll recover 20% of his Max HP, leave the domain with the cooldowns of Frenzy Strike and Instant Blast reset, and continue to fight as Lieh for 8s.\\nIf Yin fails to pull his target into the domain, the skill will enter a 3s cooldown.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After a short delay, Yin locks onto an enemy hero (\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"cannot lock onto pets or clones\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\") and pulls them into a domain for up to 8s and turns into \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lieh\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". When in the domain, the two cannot be affected by other heroes' skills.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lieh\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" has stronger skills and 50 extra \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Defense\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Defense\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" that last 8s.\\nThe domain will end early if either of the two is killed. If \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lieh\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" successfully kills the enemy, he'll recover 20% of his Max HP, leave the domain with the cooldowns of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Frenzy Strike\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Instant Blast\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" reset, and continue to fight as \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lieh\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for 8s.\\nIf Yin fails to pull his target into the domain, the skill will enter a 3s cooldown.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"52s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_772f992a2b08481a7d0f876e1c1ace56.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"mathilda\",\"heroName\":\"Mathilda\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Yin works best with Supports that can enhance his mobility, such as Mathilda and Rafaela to help him get to the enemy and eliminate key targets.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Yin works best with Supports that can enhance his mobility, such as Mathilda and Rafaela to help him get to the enemy and eliminate key targets.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Yin should use his 1st Skill to gain Movement Speed and then his 2nd Skill to get close to a key enemy and hit them with his enhanced Basic Attack before trapping them in his Ultimate. In Lieh form, use his 2nd Skill to stun the enemy and finish them off with his 1st Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_927d2396bfbe124ced32fec90158a316.png\"},{\"skillId\":11320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9840f60d6b05aa1cb9513397d574df12.png\"},{\"skillId\":11300,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":11330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_772f992a2b08481a7d0f876e1c1ace56.png\"},{\"skillId\":2011320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bd208d41c28fbdc474d8381a52a5048b.png\"},{\"skillId\":2011310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e34f614b0fe2d29abc6364e3a2ab4969.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Yin should use his 1st Skill to gain Movement Speed, then use his 2nd Skill to dash behind the enemy so the Golden Rings will stun them on their return, and end with his enhanced Basic Attack.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_927d2396bfbe124ced32fec90158a316.png\"},{\"skillId\":11320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9840f60d6b05aa1cb9513397d574df12.png\"},{\"skillId\":11300,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Yin build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. War Axe power spike, domain execution targets, passive damage mechanics, and when not to pick him.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Yin is a jungle fighter built around one question: can you find the right target and beat them alone in eight seconds? Everything in his kit feeds that question, and understanding its limits is what separates players who win with him from players who feed their own team.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"yin\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-pickoff-default\",\"name\":\"Jungle Pickoff Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\",\"cost\":3010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\",\"cost\":2060,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"seasoned-hunter\",\"name\":\"Seasoned Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/seasoned-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"killing-spree\",\"name\":\"Killing Spree\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/killing-spree.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"retribution\",\"name\":\"Retribution\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"ice-retribution\",\"name\":\"Ice Retribution\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy draft is mostly physical and crowd control is not the main reason your domain fails.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the isolated target relies on healing, shields, or high extra HP more than armor stacking.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield saves the first entry better than a delayed revive.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when Yin is ahead but the target survives long enough that a low-HP damage reduction window matters.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default jungle setup for reaching level four on time, isolating a carry with Ice Retribution, and converting one domain kill into reset tempo.\",\"totalCost\":12000,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":335,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Hunter Strike\",\"Blade of Despair\",\"Malefic Roar\"]},{\"key\":\"physpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":1200,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Blade of Despair\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Hunter Strike\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=yin\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cwar-axe%2Chunter-strike%2Cblade-of-despair%2Cmalefic-roar%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=ice-retrib