two Turtles created a lead and Yin needs the domain to end before defensive items come online.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when sticking to targets and resisting control matters more than cutting through armor.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when front-loaded magic burst deletes Yin before Queen's Wings can extend the duel.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated magic damage that chips Yin before he can choose a domain target.\"}],\"notes\":\"Durable jungle setup for games where Yin still farms as the core but must survive longer domain duels and messy Lord exits.\",\"totalCost\":11240,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":175,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Hunter Strike\",\"Malefic Roar\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"physpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":1800,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Immortality\"]},