 top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The Pick Conditions for Yin\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Yin earns his slot when three things line up simultaneously: the enemy team has a squishy, immobile carry your team cannot otherwise reach, their lineup has no heroes who specifically break the domain, and your remaining four teammates can hold a four-on-four for eight seconds without collapsing.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"That third condition is the one most Yin players skip. When My Turn activates, Yin removes one hero from the teamfight and vanishes for up to eight seconds. Your four face their four. If your four cannot hold, it does not matter whether Yin wins the domain, because the game will be over by the time he exits.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Five specific enemy picks turn Yin from a weapon into a liability. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Kaja\"}],\" can suppress Yin before he finishes the pre-ult combo, stopping the pull entirely. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Franco\"}],\" hooks him mid-approach, burning Yin's positioning and giving the enemy a free cooldown window. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Argus\"}],\" activates his ult right before the killing blow inside the domain, becomes invincible, and waits Yin out until the arena expires. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Zhask\"}],\" at level 4 summons Nightmaric Spawn inside the domain, forcing Yin to kill two bodies in eight seconds with no assistance. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Sun\"}],\" fills the domain with doppelgangers that scatter Yin's target priority and dilute his damage window.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\"],\"$L8a\",\"$L8b\"],\"$L8c\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a2:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb2:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"yu-zhong\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/yu-zhong\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{